        {
          "id": "b2c4114b-2bcf-4972-879e-fba87f89bd4b",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "I now have everything for the three panels. Here is the dashboard, grounded entirely in graph rows.\n\n## Checkpoint-Inhibitor Myocarditis — Safety Signal Dashboard\n\n**Direct answer:** The graph holds a live, corroborated safety signal for **immune-related myocarditis** (`AE-MYOCARDITIS`) with **anti-PD-1 checkpoint inhibitors** (`DRUG-CPI`). It is disproportionate (**PRR 4.2 / ROR 4.6**, 37 FAERS cases), mechanistically explained by **PD-1/PDCD1 blockade in T-cell immune-checkpoint signaling**, and supported by FAERS data, literature, a clinical registry, a genetic association, and an FDA label warning.\n\n---\n\n### 📊 Panel 1 — Disproportionality (the signal)\n`AE-MYOCARDITIS —[:HAS_STAT]→ STAT-MYO-CPI`\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|---|---|\n| PRR | **4.2** (95% CI 2.9–6.1) |\n| ROR | **4.6** |\n| χ² | 58.3 |\n| Cases | **37** |\n\nSource stat node: `STAT-MYO-CPI` — \"Disproportionality (PRR 4.2)\". 6 `Patient` nodes have `REPORTS` edges to this AE.\n\n### 🔬 Panel 2 — Mechanism\n`AE-MYOCARDITIS —[:SUSPECTED_IN]→ DRUG-CPI —[:TARGETS]→ TGT-PDCD1 —[:IN_PATHWAY]→ PW-CHECKPOINT`\n\n- **Drug:** `DRUG-CPI` — Checkpoint inhibitor (anti-PD-1)\n- **Target:** `TGT-PDCD1` — PD-1 / PDCD1\n- **Pathway:** `PW-CHECKPOINT` — T-cell immune checkpoint signaling\n- The drug also carries a direct `CANDIDATE_SIGNAL` edge to `PW-CHECKPOINT`, confirming the pathway as the flagged mechanism.\n\n### 📚 Panel 3 — Supporting evidence\nDirectly attached to the stat via `STAT-MYO-CPI —[:SUPPORTED_BY]→`:\n- `EV-FAERS` — openFDA FAERS aggregate 2024Q1–2026Q2 (records=37)\n- `EV-PMID` — Lit: checkpoint-inhibitor myocarditis (PMID 99000001)\n\nWider corroboration on `DRUG-CPI` / `TGT-PDCD1`:\n- **Literature:** `LIT-PMID-27959767` (fulminant myocarditis w/ combination blockade); `LIT-PMID-29442540` (irAE management)\n- **Clinical trial:** `CT-NCT02743819` — Checkpoint inhibitor safety registry\n- **Regulatory:** `REG-FDA-CPI-MYOCARDITIS` — FDA label, immune-mediated myocarditis warning (BLA 125514)\n- **Genetic:** `GA-OT-PDCD1-MYOCARDITIS` — Open Targets PDCD1–myocarditis association (`GENETIC_EVIDENCE`→`TGT-PDCD1`)\n\n---\n\n**Note on data hygiene:** a second node `AE-CONFLICT` (\"Myocarditis (conflicting status)\", `attrs: status=refuted`) shares the same ontology code `OAE_0001489` but has **no** `HAS_STAT`/signal edges — it is a refuted duplicate and is excluded from the active signal above.\n\n**Nodes cited:** `AE-MYOCARDITIS`, `STAT-MYO-CPI`, `DRUG-CPI`, `TGT-PDCD1`, `PW-CHECKPOINT`, `EV-FAERS`, `EV-PMID`, `LIT-PMID-27959767`, `LIT-PMID-29442540`, `CT-NCT02743819`, `REG-FDA-CPI-MYOCARDITIS`, `GA-OT-PDCD1-MYOCARDITIS`, `AE-CONFLICT`.",
          "toolCalls": [
            {
              "id": "7ef5e59c-9cb1-4336-a60c-4e7f9b7a1164",
              "type": "function",
              "function": {
                "name": "route_strategy",
                "arguments": "{\"strategy\":\"cypher-traversal\",\"reason\":\"The question asks about relationships, so a read-only Cypher traversal is the right approach. Seeded 5 candidate nodes to verify against the graph.\",\"seedNodeIds\":[\"REG-FDA-CPI-MYOCARDITIS\",\"CT-NCT02743819\",\"EV-PMID\",\"LIT-PMID-27959767\",\"PW-CHECKPOINT\"]}"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "7959b646-20b9-4244-ae20-1eda301fd3a0",
              "type": "function",
              "function": {
                "name": "read_neo4j_cypher",
                "arguments": "{\"step\":\"Inspected the live graph schema\"}"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d116aa9b-2a6d-4bb4-b8a3-bfe1a9ef43e4",
              "type": "function",
              "function": {
                "name": "read_neo4j_cypher",
                "arguments": "{\"step\":\"Inspected the live graph schema\"}"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "811a4519-9ebd-400c-8613-d47205fc0fd1",
              "type": "function",
              "function": {
                "name": "read_neo4j_cypher",
                "arguments": "{\"query\":\"MATCH (ae:AdverseEvent)\\nWHERE toLower(ae.label) CONTAINS 'myocard'\\nOPTIONAL MATCH (ae)-[:HAS_STAT]->(s:SignalStat)\\nRETURN ae.id AS aeId, ae.label AS aeLabel, ae.code AS aeCode, ae.attrsRaw AS aeAttrs,\\n       collect({id:s.id, label:s.label, attrs:s.attrsRaw, code:s.code}) AS stats\"}"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "5ede6510-1ad0-43fd-96a6-b929b88ba285",
              "type": "function",
              "function": {
                "name": "read_neo4j_cypher",
                "arguments": "{\"query\":\"MATCH (ae:AdverseEvent {id:'AE-MYOCARDITIS'})\\nOPTIONAL MATCH (ae)-[:SUSPECTED_IN]->(d:Drug)\\nOPTIONAL MATCH (d)-[:TARGETS]->(t:BiologicalTarget)\\nOPTIONAL MATCH (t)-[:IN_PATHWAY]->(pw:Pathway)\\nOPTIONAL MATCH (d)-[:CANDIDATE_SIGNAL]->(pw2:Pathway)\\nRETURN d.id AS drugId, d.label AS drug,\\n       collect(DISTINCT {id:t.id,label:t.label}) AS targets,\\n       collect(DISTINCT {id:pw.id,label:pw.label}) AS pathwaysViaTarget,\\n       collect(DISTINCT {id:pw2.id,label:pw2.label}) AS candidateSignalPathways\"}"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "0c561e3d-64a6-40be-80ce-7362f9aa44f5",
              "type": "function",
              "function": {
                "name": "read_neo4j_cypher",
                "arguments": "{\"query\":\"MATCH (ae:AdverseEvent {id:'AE-MYOCARDITIS'})-[:HAS_STAT]->(s:SignalStat {id:'STAT-MYO-CPI'})\\nOPTIONAL MATCH (s)-[:SUPPORTED_BY]->(e)\\nRETURN labels(e) AS labels, e.id AS id, e.label AS label, e.code AS code, e.attrsRaw AS attrs\"}"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "1db8565f-efcc-4687-b878-b20aecb19b97",
              "type": "function",
              "function": {
                "name": "read_neo4j_cypher",
                "arguments": "{\"query\":\"MATCH (d:Drug {id:'DRUG-CPI'})\\nOPTIONAL MATCH (lit:LiteratureAbstract)-[:MENTIONS]->(d)\\nOPTIONAL MATCH (ct:ClinicalTrial)-[:STUDIES]->(d)\\nOPTIONAL MATCH (rd:RegulatoryDoc)-[:HAS_LABEL]->(d)\\nOPTIONAL MATCH (ga:GeneticAssociation)-[:GENETIC_EVIDENCE]->(:BiologicalTarget {id:'TGT-PDCD1'})\\nOPTIONAL MATCH (p:Patient)-[:REPORTS]->(:AdverseEvent {id:'AE-MYOCARDITIS'})\\nRETURN collect(DISTINCT {id:lit.id,label:lit.label}) AS literature,\\n       collect(DISTINCT {id:ct.id,label:ct.label}) AS trials,\\n       collect(DISTINCT {id:rd.id,label:rd.label}) AS regDocs,\\n       collect(DISTINCT {id:ga.id,label:ga.label}) AS genetics,\\n       count(DISTINCT p) AS patientReports\"}"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c2e968b6-b32d-4026-bbce-6207a9ad030b",
